//   Location(s):
//   Timeframe:
//   Notes:
//
// Conclusion:
//   [ ] No suspicious activity identified — no persistence mechanisms identified for this account in the post-sign-in window (OfficeActivity)
//   [ ] Suspicious activity identified — escalating
//   [ ] False positive — reason:
